  "steps": [
    "Dry-roast the toor dal on low heat for 3 minutes, stirring, until it just starts to colour, then add the chana dal and urad dal.",
    "Add the dried red chilli, pepper and cumin seeds and roast for another 3 minutes until fragrant.",
    "Add the curry leaves and hing and roast until the leaves turn crisp.",
    "Let everything cool completely.",
    "Grind with the salt to a coarse powder and store in an airtight jar."
  ]
